1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,280
Good morning students. Today we will revise Newton's three laws of motion. First, an object remains at rest or in uniform motion unless acted upon by an external force. Second, force equals mass multiplied by acceleration. Third, every action has an equal and opposite reaction.

